    "My Digital Twin/avatar identity",
    "Creator Workstation and Asset Forge integration",
    "creator-made content and moderation pipeline",
    "game marketplace and licensed digital goods",
    "AI GameOps and automated bounded repair",
    "telemetry, fraud/cheat detection and audit logs",
    "accessibility and multilingual support"
  ],
